                                                "example_id": "85834318-3091-4da2-bc40-9c2b40beba56",
                                                "sense_id": "d4710a5f-98de-34d1-815e-e28ed920c107",
                                                "text": "I find the enduring existence of high heels both a frustrating mystery and a testament to the triumph of women’s neuroses over their mobility."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "b2c9a6dd-c1c9-4f85-9786-5061c7c7933d",
                                                "sense_id": "d4710a5f-98de-34d1-815e-e28ed920c107",
                                                "text": "In the late 19th and early 20th century, the festive season was also a period of great mobility before, during and after Christmas Day. But the railways kept working."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "0acf118e-248e-3a3a-a696-d55cef735ced",
                                        "entry_id": "223c5b06-92af-3df8-95be-8ab412e81375",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "A tendency to sudden change; mutability, changeableness."
