                                                "sense_id": "755e886d-cb1c-3587-bf31-a9f426f69997",
                                                "text": "The difficulty of rising up the economic ladder is reflected in the decline in mobility in the United States. […] The frustration over the lack of mobility is particularly acute for those without college degrees."
